PNV 1
EPISTEMIC CHYBA
MODE READ_ONLY
# Imported TCD field and diagnostic PhaseNav realization; explicit visual state.
# The renderer is a presentation boundary, not an affect producer.
OP IDENTITY SOURCE affect.identity
OP FIELD SOURCE affect.tcd_field
OP PHASE SOURCE affect.tcd_phase36
OP TERMS SOURCE affect.tcd_term_ids
OP SOURCE_REF SOURCE affect.source_ref
OP STRANDS SOURCE appearance.hair_strands
OP HAIR COMPOSITION IDENTITY SOURCE_REF FIELD PHASE TERMS STRANDS
EMIT HAIR
